WEBVTT

00:00:00.603 --> 00:00:01.454
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:02.558 --> 00:00:03.949
<v><b>M:</b></v> I love Daisy.

00:00:09.147 --> 00:00:10.122
I love her.

00:00:12.002 --> 00:00:12.703
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:13.909 --> 00:00:15.909
<v><b>F:</b></v> I don’t like dogs.

00:00:20.845 --> 00:00:22.196
I don’t like them.

00:00:24.116 --> 00:00:24.915
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:26.105 --> 00:00:27.704
<v><b>M:</b></v> I like your house.

00:00:32.759 --> 00:00:33.718
I like it.

00:00:35.622 --> 00:00:36.331
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:37.521 --> 00:00:38.962
<v><b>F:</b></v> Wait for Daniel.

00:00:44.176 --> 00:00:45.207
Wait for him.

00:00:47.159 --> 00:00:47.987
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:00:49.081 --> 00:00:50.195
<v><b>M:</b></v> Read the book.

00:00:55.514 --> 00:00:56.259
Read it.

00:00:58.044 --> 00:00:58.983
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:01:00.197 --> 00:01:01.508
<v><b>F:</b></v> I love cats.

00:01:06.833 --> 00:01:07.994
I love them.

00:01:09.851 --> 00:01:10.775
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 7

00:01:11.901 --> 00:01:13.253
<v><b>M:</b></v> Speak to your mother.

00:01:18.499 --> 00:01:19.489
Speak to her.

00:01:21.425 --> 00:01:22.126
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 8

00:01:23.419 --> 00:01:25.080
<v><b>F:</b></v> I don’t like your brother.

00:01:30.349 --> 00:01:31.628
I don’t like him.